# Scratch tsc output. Compiling a throwaway `*.tmp.ts` probe at the repo root
# (an ad-hoc "does this decorator emit that header?" check) leaves its emitted
# .js/.d.ts/.js.map behind. Never source, always disposable.
*.tmp.js
*.tmp.d.ts
*.tmp.js.map

